Caelza M4 phase 1: the dashboard wears the brand, and installs as an app.

Self-hosted Inter Tight / JetBrains Mono / Orbitron (web/src/caelza-brand.css,
fonts copied by brand/make_assets.py) with Inter Tight as the default UI face;
the lockup (web/src/components/brand/CaelzaLockup.tsx) in the mobile drawer
and on the pairing screen; the parent's attribution in both sidebar footers;
labelled accent swatches; the PWA manifest, icons and service worker
(web/public, registered by web/src/pwa.ts) with the gateway sending
Service-Worker-Allowed for sw.js so the worker may claim the SPA root.
Applied by runtime/build.sh after the rename and after the overlay; regenerate
with the same `diff -u` when the upstream pin moves.

